  "source": "Safari (WebKit copy of a web page, captured on macOS 27 through WKWebView)",
  "html": "<head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"></head><h2 style=\"font-family: Georgia; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">Release notes</h2><p class=\"lead\" style=\"font-weight: 600; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">A<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span><b>bold</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span>start,<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span><i>italic</i><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span>words,<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span><code>inline code</code><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span>and<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span><a href=\"https://example.com/docs\">a link</a>.</p><ul style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li>First item</li><li>Second item<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0</span><strong>strong</strong></li></ul><ol start=\"3\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start;